        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "p is 'causally upstream or within' q iff p is causally related to q, and the end of p precedes, or is coincident with, the end of q.",
        
            Annotations: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ro/releases/2023-02-22/ro.owl>
        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "We would like to make this disjoint with 'preceded by', but this is prohibited in OWL2",
        
            Annotations: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ro/releases/2023-02-22/ro.owl>
        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165>,
        
            Annotations: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ro/releases/2023-02-22/ro.owl>
        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> "influences (processual)",
        
