    Annotations: 
        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A simulation scenario is a plan specification that references a simulation configuration and contains objective specifications to motivate the planned analysis."@en,
        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> "Simulationsszenario"@de,
        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> "simulation scenario"@en,
        rdfs:comment "In the simulation community, the typical term for this concept is \"simulation scenario\", which denotes a different kind of scenario than the oeo:scenario (OEO_00000364). A simulation scenario might use an oeo:scenario as basis for its parametrisation."@en,
        rdfs:comment "The bearer of the simulation plan specification is the researcher, starting the simulation and analysing the results."@en,
        rdfs:label "simulation plan specification"@en,
