        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Change in which the dependent entity alternates between two or more stases."@en,
        
            Annotations: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/releases/2.11.0/imports/cco-extracted.omn>
        <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Oscillation&oldid=1002978272"^^xsd:anyURI,
        
