        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Operational Stasis that holds during a Temporal Interval when an Artifact is first put into operational use such that its designed set of Artifact Functions is capable of operating at or near their designed peak performance levels."@en,
        
            Annotations: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/releases/2.11.0/imports/cco-extracted.omn>
        <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001753> "BOL",
        
            Annotations: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/releases/2.11.0/imports/cco-extracted.omn>
        <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001753> "BoL",
        
            Annotations: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/releases/2.11.0/imports/cco-extracted.omn>
        <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^xsd:anyURI
    
